    "Definitions from Wiktionary by its contributors, under the CC BY-SA 4.0 licence. Compiled by reader.dict. Shortened and reformatted by Folito." : {
      "comment" : "Dictionary credit (required by the CC BY-SA licence). Keep the names Wiktionary, reader.dict and CC BY-SA 4.0",
